It is all done by @dubbo-bot which is a collaborate robot.\n\n\n## Repo Overview\n\n### Basic data\n\nBaisc data shows how the watch, star, fork and contributors count changed in the passed week.\n\n| Watch | Star | Fork | Contributors |\n|:-----:|:----:|:----:|:------------:|\n| 3186 | 24549 (↑121) | 13903 (↑98) | 176 (↑1) |\n\n### Issues & PRs\n\nIssues & PRs show the new/closed issues/pull requests count in the passed week.\n\n| New Issues | Closed Issues | New PR | Merged PR |\n|:----------:|:-------------:|:------:|:---------:|\n| 22 | 70 | 35 | 22 |\n\n## PR Overview\n\nThanks to contributions from community, Dubbo team merged **22** pull requests in the repository last week. They are:\n\n* avoid of using synchronized. ([#3532](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3532))\n* Fix accidentally check exchanger in setDispatcher()(#3518) ([#3527](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3527))\n* fix context filter's bug ([#3526](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3526))\n* fix ScriptRouter中的CompiledScript应该缓存 #390 ([#3524](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3524))\n* apply #2220 to 2.6.x branch, issue #2178 ([#3519](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3519))\n* fix #3514 ([#3515](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3515))\n* bump up hessian-lite version #3423 ([#3513](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3513))\n* Apply #2925 to branch 2.6.x ([#3511](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3511))\n* Fix inefficient use of keySet iterator instead of entrySet iterator ([#3508](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3508))\n* Fix invocation of toString on an array ([#3507](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3507))\n* revise the naming conventions of test case ([#3506](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3506))\n* fix issue#1293: A question for ReferenceConfigCache. ([#3505](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3505))\n* apply #3295 to 2.6 branch ([#3502](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3502))\n* Boolean class use method toString() instead of String.valueof() ([#3495](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3495))\n* [Enhancement]: fix typo ([#3491](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3491))\n* [Enhancement]: refactor categorizing with Collectors.groupingBy ([#3490](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3490))\n* [Enhancement]: language level migration ([#3485](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3485))\n* [Enhancement]: RestProtocol ([#3480](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3480))\n* Branch refactor version ([#3471](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3471))\n* fix issue #1917: Condition is not properly used ? ([#3466](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3466))\n* [Dubbo-3106]Make getRegistered return unmodifiable collection. #3106 ([#3425](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3425))\n* Mostly modification to satisfy more complexing support scenrio such as service Level model ([#3264](https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/pull/3264))\n\n\n## Code Review Statistics\n\nDubbo encourages everyone to participant in code review, in order to improve software quality. Every week @dubbo-bot would automatically help to count pull request reviews of single github user as the following. So, try to help review code in this project.\n\n| Contributor ID | Pull Request Reviews |\n|:--------------:|:--------------------:|\n| @kezhenxu94 | 7 |\n| @lixiaojiee | 6 |\n| @khanimteyaz | 4 |\n| @chickenlj | 3 |\n| @CrazyHZM | 3 |\n| @scxwhite | 2 |\n| @ralf0131 | 2 |\n| @beiwei30 | 1 |\n| @carryxyh | 1 |\n| @wanghbxxxx | 1 |\n| @htynkn | 1 |\n\n\n## Contributors Overview\n\nIt is Dubbo team's great honor to have new contributors from community. We really appreciate your contributions. Feel free to tell us if you have any opinion and please share this open source project with more people if you could. If you hope to be a contributor as well, please start from https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md .\nHere is the list of new contributors:\n\n@hiroakiy\n\n\nThanks to you all.\n\n\n\n*Note: This robot is supported by [Collabobot](https://github.com/AlibabaDR/Collabobot).*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/3541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/3541/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2228669397,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDIyMjg2NjkzOTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/events/2228669397","actor":{"login":"Jeff-Lv","id":6000915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDA5MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6000915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv","html_url":"https://github.com/Jeff-Lv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jeff-Lv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"897b80de3840c0bc9d9928dc1fb3f28ca8d78cc7","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/commits/897b80de3840c0bc9d9928dc1fb3f28ca8d78cc7","created_at":"2019-03-26T06:28:41Z","performed_via_github_app":null}]